## Known limitations / next steps

- **MVP ingests FDA *food* recalls only.** Drug/device (openFDA) and vehicle
  (NHTSA) recalls are natural next additions — the `recalls.source` column and
  the `kind` field are already in place for them. (A vehicle on a watchlist
  currently has no legitimate recall to match; the agent correctly flags such
  low-confidence matches as likely false positives rather than alarming the
  user — a deliberate guardrail.)
- **Scheduled refresh:** the Spark ingest runs on demand; a scheduled Databricks
  Job would keep recalls current (openFDA updates weekly).
- **Informational only:** per openFDA terms, this is awareness tooling, not a
  substitute for official FDA/manufacturer guidance.
